        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Taxa: Nesoryzomys, Megaoryzomys\n- Biological classification: Oryzomyini, Thomasomyini, Cricetidae\n- Places: Galápagos Islands\n\nFacts:\n- Nesoryzomys is a genus of rodent in the tribe Oryzomyini of the family Cricetidae.\n- Nesoryzomys is endemic to the Galápagos Islands.\n- Megaoryzomys has unclear taxonomic relationships.\n- Megaoryzomys has been placed in both Oryzomyini and Thomasomyini in the past.",
